{"Authors":{"Names":["司马光"],"AuthorIds":[23461],"Dynasties":["Song"]},"ShiData":[{"Id":81668,"Classes":["軍旅 入塞"],"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"删","Rank":0,"FirstClauseRhyme":"删","Title":{"Content":"入塞"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"万骑入榆关，"},{"Content":"皋兰苦战还。"},{"Content":"摧锋佩刀缺，","Comments":[{"Content":"原作樵，据陈本、四库本改","Type":"Text","Index":1}]},{"Content":"蹋血马蹄殷。"},{"Content":"铙吹来风外，"},{"Content":"牛羊出雾间。"},{"Content":"须知沙塞恶，"},{"Content":"壮士变衰颜。"}]},{"Id":81194,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"真","Rank":0,"FirstClauseRhyme":"真","Title":{"Content":"喜孙器之来自共城"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"取友不无人，"},{"Content":"爱君天性真。"},{"Content":"远寻穷巷宅，"},{"Content":"未拂满衣尘。"},{"Content":"主礼贫尤重，","Comments":[{"Content":"原作王，据四库本改","Type":"Text","Index":1}]},{"Content":"交情别更亲。"},{"Content":"谁家酿醇酒，"},{"Content":"尽醉准衣巾。"}]},{"Id":81113,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"麻","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"送韩太祝知钱塘","Comments":[{"Content":"镇","Type":"Text","Index":4}]},"Clauses":[{"Content":"冠佩郁相映，"},{"Content":"由来积德家。"},{"Content":"一时推隽异，"},{"Content":"四海走声华。"},{"Content":"图籍添舟重，"},{"Content":"江山忘路赊。"},{"Content":"夷涂指霄汉，"},{"Content":"跼骥不须嗟。"}]},{"Id":80950,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"支","Rank":0,"FirstClauseRhyme":"齐","Title":{"Content":"和聂之美雁"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"汲汲复栖栖，"},{"Content":"往来谁与期。"},{"Content":"映云才可见，"},{"Content":"入雾杳难追。"},{"Content":"羁枕梦初断，"},{"Content":"寒闺涕已危。"},{"Content":"冥冥远缯缴，"},{"Content":"愧尔独知时。"}]},{"Id":81409,"GroupIndex":1,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"侵","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"和之美河西列岫亭"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"秋山对疏牖，"},{"Content":"羁客倦登临。"},{"Content":"雨后岚光活，"},{"Content":"晴初落照深。"},{"Content":"素波明别浦，"},{"Content":"赤叶照衰林。"},{"Content":"伫目寂无语，"},{"Content":"何人知此心。"}]},{"Id":499424,"GroupIndex":2,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"麻","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"和之美河西列岫亭"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"亭皋资远瞩，"},{"Content":"秋思浩无涯。"},{"Content":"雁唼牵菱蔓，"},{"Content":"童歌出荻花。"},{"Content":"垄荒犹叱犊，"},{"Content":"枝暗稍栖鸦。"},{"Content":"烟霭藏东渚，"},{"Content":"凭轩莫望家。"}]},{"Id":80760,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"豪","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"书事"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"志士喜功业，"},{"Content":"感时心易劳。"},{"Content":"蘖栽终栝柏，"},{"Content":"荒蔓任蓬蒿。"},{"Content":"梁竦慵为吏，"},{"Content":"萧咸耻诣曹。"},{"Content":"风霜果不变，"},{"Content":"会见出云高。"}]},{"Id":81281,"GroupIndex":1,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"灰","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"钓鱼有感"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"垂竿临晚岸，"},{"Content":"坚坐据莓苔。"},{"Content":"饵落萍初散，"},{"Content":"鱼惊荷暂开。"},{"Content":"有求虽琐细，"},{"Content":"未获且低回。"},{"Content":"君识磻溪老，"},{"Content":"曾垂绿发来。"}]},{"Id":81359,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"尤","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"田家"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"未塞豪人夺，"},{"Content":"何言公赋收。"},{"Content":"皇心虽恻隐，"},{"Content":"蓬户或焦愁。"},{"Content":"为吏空多禄，"},{"Content":"无人能此忧。"},{"Content":"知君坐公府，"},{"Content":"佗日富民侯。"}]},{"Id":81571,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"真","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"送赵书记之官华州","Comments":[{"Content":"众","Type":"Text","Index":4}]},"Clauses":[{"Content":"车马西城外，"},{"Content":"遥遥未有尘。"},{"Content":"辞梁犹带雪，"},{"Content":"过洛渐生春。"},{"Content":"幕府斜依岳，"},{"Content":"关山曲抱秦。"},{"Content":"曩来谟画拙，"},{"Content":"不必笑前人。"}]},{"Id":81055,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"东","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"送华亭沈主簿"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"执袂青门道，"},{"Content":"萧萧马欲东。"},{"Content":"暮云零落翠，"},{"Content":"远树浅深红。"},{"Content":"楚泽吟声里，"},{"Content":"吴山醉眼中。"},{"Content":"相思杳何许，"},{"Content":"野鹤唳高风。"}]},{"Id":81404,"GroupIndex":1,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"东","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"闰正月十五日夜监直对月怀诸同舍"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"雾净金波溢，"},{"Content":"天开碧幕空。"},{"Content":"夜寒虽料峭，"},{"Content":"春意自冲融。"},{"Content":"熠熠枝上露，"},{"Content":"翛翛竹杪风。"},{"Content":"暂还林野兴，"},{"Content":"不似畜樊笼。"}]},{"Id":80871,"GroupIndex":2,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"庚","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"闰正月十五日夜监直对月怀诸同舍"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"澹薄春云散，"},{"Content":"低昂北斗横。"},{"Content":"微分汉津雁，"},{"Content":"静识建章更。"},{"Content":"浊酒怜虚爵，"},{"Content":"高文忆友生。"},{"Content":"前轩空不掩，"},{"Content":"怅息负孤清。"}]},{"Id":80773,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"萧","Rank":0,"FirstClauseRhyme":"萧","Title":{"Content":"忆庞之道"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"畴昔两垂髫，"},{"Content":"知音结久要。"},{"Content":"何言半涂别，"},{"Content":"不待岁寒彫。"},{"Content":"幸有才名在，"},{"Content":"非随气运消。"},{"Content":"英灵犹彷佛，"},{"Content":"宿草已萧萧。"}]},{"Id":81094,"GroupIndex":1,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"寒","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"送郑推官赴邠州","Comments":[{"Content":"戡","Type":"Text","Index":4}]},"Clauses":[{"Content":"形便豳公国，"},{"Content":"旌旗拥将坛。"},{"Content":"秦云低落日，"},{"Content":"塞树怯春寒。"},{"Content":"草檄无留思，"},{"Content":"投壶不废欢。"},{"Content":"还应笑黄卷，"},{"Content":"寂寂守儒官。"}]},{"Id":81093,"GroupIndex":2,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"豪","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"送郑推官赴邠州","Comments":[{"Content":"戡","Type":"Text","Index":4}]},"Clauses":[{"Content":"百榼行春乐，"},{"Content":"千弓从猎豪。"},{"Content":"苦吟边月冷，"},{"Content":"飞镝野风高。"},{"Content":"奇策鞭殊俗，"},{"Content":"长缨系不毛。"},{"Content":"输君跃马贵，"},{"Content":"一等着青袍。"}]},{"Id":81092,"Classes":["軍旅 送行"],"GroupIndex":3,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"庚","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"送郑推官赴邠州","Comments":[{"Content":"戡","Type":"Text","Index":4}]},"Clauses":[{"Content":"骄虏已归计，"},{"Content":"圣朝方寝兵。"},{"Content":"时闻候火入，"},{"Content":"非复塞尘惊。"},{"Content":"秋岭无南牧，"},{"Content":"春田恣北耕。"},{"Content":"休穷西海路，"},{"Content":"辛苦学甘英。"}]},{"Id":80749,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"微","Rank":0,"FirstClauseRhyme":"微","Title":{"Content":"上巳日与太学诸同舍饮王都尉园"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"冠盖郁相依，"},{"Content":"名园花未稀。"},{"Content":"游丝萦复展，"},{"Content":"狂絮堕还飞。"},{"Content":"积弩遗风陋，"},{"Content":"兰亭旧俗微。"},{"Content":"何如咏沂水，"},{"Content":"春服舞雩归。"}]},{"Id":81167,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"尤","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"寄题洪州慈济师西轩"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"登临传胜绝，"},{"Content":"怅息未成游。"},{"Content":"山气高凌霁，"},{"Content":"湖光碧照秋。"},{"Content":"烟疏茶灶迥，"},{"Content":"灯冷竹房幽。"},{"Content":"安得聊凭槛，"},{"Content":"萧然洗客愁。"}]},{"Id":80756,"Dynasty":"北宋","Author":"司马光","AuthorId":23461,"Type":"律诗","TypeDetail":"WuLv","Rhyme":"蒸","Rank":0,"Title":{"Content":"山头春色"},"Clauses":[{"Content":"天意欲回煦，"},{"Content":"群生稍郁蒸。"},{"Content":"平田犹未遍，"},{"Content":"绝岭独先升。"},{"Content":"翠色添崖柏，"},{"Content":"寒声折涧冰。"},{"Content":"谁为物外友，"},{"Content":"挈手共同登。"}]}],"Count":1270,"PageNo":6,"PageSize":20}